@startuml Hinh_2_12_Sequence_Double_Entry_Ledger
title Hình 2.12 – Sequence: Chuyển khoản nội bộ & Sổ cái kép (Double-Entry)
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

actor "Người dùng A" as UserA
participant "TransactionController" as Ctrl
participant "TransactionService" as TxSvc
participant "LedgerService" as Ledger
database "PostgreSQL" as DB

UserA -> Ctrl : POST /transactions/transfer\n{destAccountNumber, amount, idempotencyKey}
Ctrl -> TxSvc : transfer(request, userAId)

TxSvc -> DB : findByIdempotencyKey\n(tránh trùng lặp)
TxSvc -> DB : Tìm Account nguồn & đích
TxSvc -> TxSvc : Kiểm tra balance >= amount\n+ KYC + status ACTIVE

TxSvc -> DB : **BEGIN TRANSACTION**

TxSvc -> DB : INSERT Transaction\n(type=TRANSFER, status=SUCCESS)

TxSvc -> Ledger : createEntry(DEBIT, source, amount)
Ledger -> DB : UPDATE accounts SET balance -= amount\nINSERT ledger_entries (DEBIT)
Ledger -> DB : CHECK balance >= 0

TxSvc -> Ledger : createEntry(CREDIT, dest, amount)
Ledger -> DB : UPDATE accounts SET balance += amount\nINSERT ledger_entries (CREDIT)

TxSvc -> DB : **COMMIT**

TxSvc -> TxSvc : publish Kafka event
TxSvc --> Ctrl : TransactionResponse
Ctrl --> UserA : referenceNumber + số dư mới

note over Ledger, DB
  Mỗi TRANSFER tạo đúng 2 LedgerEntry:
  DEBIT (nguồn) + CREDIT (đích)
  Cùng transaction_id, atomic commit
end note

@enduml
